(7716135, 1268752, 77196, '<td valign="top">I find this image hard to score. I have no idea what I''m looking at. But the image words on several levels. One is the rule of thirds, with the larger light portion at the leftmost 1/3 border, making a swoosh along the lower 1/3 border, and nothing detracts the eye from this subject. I also think the monochrome effect works well for this image.</td>', 'I find this image hard to score. I have no idea what I''m looking at. But the image words on several levels. One is the rule of thirds, with the larger light portion at the leftmost 1/3 border, making a swoosh along the lower 1/3 border, and nothing detracts the eye from this subject. I also think the monochrome effect works well for this image.', '2022-03-07 11:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7716198, 1268771, 67723, '<td valign="top">I love the halation around the lights on the towers. Great atmosphere.</td>', 'I love the halation around the lights on the towers. Great atmosphere.', '2022-03-08 05:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7716199, 1268686, 67723, '<td valign="top">I like the complimenting blues in this photo.</td>', 'I like the complimenting blues in this photo.', '2022-03-08 05:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7716219, 1268689, 77196, '<td valign="top">I found the trash can, and the left side guard rail distracting from your main subject, which I assume was the ducks. The lighting is from the left, which puts many of the most visible portions of the ducks in shadow. Perhaps a perspective a bit to the right, using framing to remove the trash can (and to its left) would have resulted with a shot where the white boulder could act as an anchor on the left. Of course, with birds, any movement could''ve scared them all away... 5</td>', 'I found the trash can, and the left side guard rail distracting from your main subject, which I assume was the ducks. The lighting is from the left, which puts many of the most visible portions of the ducks in shadow. Perhaps a perspective a bit to the right, using framing to remove the trash can (and to its left) would have resulted with a shot where the white boulder could act as an anchor on the left. Of course, with birds, any movement could''ve scared them all away... 5', '2022-03-08 11:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7716221, 1268720, 77196, '<td valign="top">For me, this image wasn''t very attractive. I wavered a while between a 5 or 6 before going with a 5 on the score. Primarily based that decision on my emotional response to the image - the highlighted wires didn''t overcome the dominant building background.</td>', 'For me, this image wasn''t very attractive. I wavered a while between a 5 or 6 before going with a 5 on the score. Primarily based that decision on my emotional response to the image - the highlighted wires didn''t overcome the dominant building background.', '2022-03-08 11:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7716222, 1268774, 77196, '<td valign="top">I liked that this image was creative. I found it interesting that the circle is only broken by a battery at the upper right corner, and that the circle is just a tad to the left of being centered.</td>', 'I liked that this image was creative. I found it interesting that the circle is only broken by a battery at the upper right corner, and that the circle is just a tad to the left of being centered.', '2022-03-08 12:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7716223, 1268704, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love abandoned buildings! I think the graffiti on the white fence at right distracts from the image - it strongly draws the eye away from the power lines and main building.</td>', 'Love abandoned buildings! I think the graffiti on the white fence at right distracts from the image - it strongly draws the eye away from the power lines and main building.', '2022-03-08 12:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
